1
00:00:35,867 --> 00:00:45,634
NovaPay's web app calls all 24 Meridian APIs through Tyk Gateway
The browser blocks every one: NovaPay is not an allowed origin

2
00:00:46,133 --> 00:00:52,800
Fragments have their own screen in Tyk Dashboard
Each one is a named piece of shared API configuration

3
00:00:53,300 --> 00:01:02,100
The Fragment lists every API that uses it
24 APIs reference this one CORS policy

4
00:01:02,600 --> 00:01:20,467
Add the partner's origin to the Fragment
One edit, one save

5
00:01:20,967 --> 00:01:30,734
Same page, reloaded
All 24 APIs now accept NovaPay. No API was edited or redeployed

6
00:01:31,233 --> 00:01:40,900
API teams see what is shared, and which Fragment sets it
The setting is read-only inside the API

7
00:01:41,400 --> 00:01:56,333
Now a mistake: a value of the wrong type
Tyk checks all 24 APIs first and refuses the save

8
00:01:56,833 --> 00:02:04,033
Nothing was saved
The partner app still works

